OL,3,GNEWSAClassrooms created in former
OL,4,AEverton stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew classrooms have been created at
OL,7,FEverton's Goodison Park stadium in a
OL,8,Fbid to inspire young learners.
OL,10,FEverton Football Club has partnered
OL,11,Fwith Everton Multi-Academy Trust to
OL,12,Finstall the learning areas in the Park
OL,13,FEnd stand, in former TV broadcast
OL,14,Fboxes.
OL,16,FThe college classrooms have been
OL,17,Fdesigned with views of the pitch in an
OL,18,Fattempt to encourage children from
OL,19,Fdisadvantaged backgrounds to attend
OL,20,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
